~ start
Helloooooo!!
I am waiting you for so long!
- Who are you?
	I am the creater of this world!
Welcome to my world!
- What do you mean "waiting you for so long"?
	Good question,
I have a request for you!
I need you to "turn off" a file for me.
- "Turn off"?
	Yes! There is a file in my computer that I can't turn it off by myself...
	Seems like there is a virus in the file that keep blocking me.
	I can't turn it off or delete it...
That's why I am waiting for you!
I need you to get inside the file, find out the issue, break it! and turn off the system!
Sounds easy right \:3!
- What should I do?
	Oh! It's pretty easy!
	I have [color=red]three drives[/color] left in the file.
You just need to find them! and plug them inside the main system!
That would "turn off" the file!
And don't worry about your personal safety, you are not really inside.
If you got any issue or danger, you will protect by the system, that's me!
- Okay, I will accept this request.
	Awesome!
Now, I will send you inside the file... Are you ready?
- Yes
	Let's goooooo!
	Good luck!!
=> END

